								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 47<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://forums.gucomics.com/images/avatars/20002703583fbef1af3a4d3.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=265105278" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=265105278&amp;img=5" alt="265105278" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/Wyztyz" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Wyztyz"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Wyztyz&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Wyztyz&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=167"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.dragonsfist.org" title="Dragons Fist" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:wyztyz@aol.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=773.msg7039#msg7039"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=773.msg7039#msg7039">Dragons Fist is recruiting.  http://www.dragonsfist.org/  </a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> April 15, 2004, 12:31:41 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div align="center"><b><a href="http://www.dragonsfist.org/" target="_blank">http://www.dragonsfist.org/</a></b></div><br /><br /><div align="center"><b><a href="http://www.guildportal.com/Guild.aspx?GuildID=11208&amp;TabID=92729" target="_blank">http://www.guildportal.com/Guild.aspx?GuildID=11208&amp;TabID=92729</a></b></div><br /><br /><div align="center"><a href="http://www.geocities.com/aaethen/" target="_blank">Dragons Fist the Comic</a><br />Created by the talented,<br />Duke Aaethen Blaxstone<br />65th Season DreadLord<br />ShadowKnight Class Officer of Dragons Fist<br />and Citizen of Rodcet Nife</div><br /><br /><span style="color: Red;"><div align="center"><b>UPDATE.  NOVEMBER 2004.  <br />We&#039;re at it again.  <br />Semi-Casual Friendly and Fun Adult Only guild.  <br />Two Scheduled Raid Days  - <br />Tuesday night 7pm pst (10 pm est) and Saturday Night 5pm pst (8 pm est). <br />We also Raid at random during the week.  <br />Our last few kills in the past two weeks:  <br />Agnarr, Saryrn, Vallon Zek, Tallon Zek, Rallos Zek the Warlord and epic mobs. </b> </div> </span> <br /><br /><div align="center"><b>ESTABLISHED July 17, 2001 STRONGER IN DETERMINATION THAN EVER! <br />Have Fun! Kick Ass! Respect Others! RL &gt; game. Keep it in Perspective!   ;D</b></div><br /><br /><b>Recruitment Open for a Limited Time </b> <br /><br /><b>Dragons Fist</b> recruiting is notably a simple and selective process. We only want team players who are loyal, share our goals and are dedicated. We want players that don&#039;t give up when things get tough.<br /><br />It&#039;s very important that recruits are honest with us when applying, as variances later will be noticed and likely to result in removal from the guild.<br /><br />For players that meet our minimum level requirement of 62  and our minimum flag requirement of Tier 1, Tier 2 and Tier 3 PoP flags , the right dedication and attitude, please complete our online Application and send a tell to any officer in game.<br /><br />Loyalty and dedication plays a prominent role in Dragons Fist.  We will gladly backflag those team players, we feel that are loyal, dedicated, and share our goals.<br /><br />If you are not in control of your life you really shouldn&#039;t be playing this highly addictive game. Dragons Fist is looking for members who know how to keep an in-game/out-of-game balance so that relationships with spouses and loved ones never reach crisis levels and so that careers and educational efforts aren&#039;t ruined. Though we take our game-time seriously, but we also believe that balance is vitally important for long term mental, social and financial stability of all guild members.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: November 24, 2004, 02:26:35 pm by Wyztyz</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Wyztyz Wyckedwytz<br />Wizardess of the Solusek Ro and the 66th Season<br />Broodmother and Guild Leader to Dragons Fist on Rodcet Nife<br />RL &gt; EQ.  Keep it in perspective!
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7041"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=167" title="View the profile of Wyztyz">Wyztyz</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
