								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 47<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://forums.gucomics.com/images/avatars/20002703583fbef1af3a4d3.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								<a href="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/about_me/1,,,00.html?Uin=265105278" target="_blank"><img src="http://web.icq.com/whitepages/online?icq=265105278&amp;img=5" alt="265105278" width="18" height="18" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/Wyztyz" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://edit.yahoo.com/config/send_webmesg?.target=Wyztyz"><img src="http://opi.yahoo.com/online?u=Wyztyz&amp;m=g&amp;t=0" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=Wyztyz&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="Wyztyz" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=167"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.dragonsfist.org" title="Dragons Fist" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:wyztyz@aol.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=773.msg7041#msg7041"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=773.msg7041#msg7041">Re:Dragons Fist is recruiting for a limited time.  </a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> April 15, 2004, 12:40:31 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<b><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Dragons Fist Short Term Goal &amp; Long Term Goal</span></b><br /><br />Our <b>short term goal </b> is to get guild members flagged for <b>Tower of Solusek Ro </b> and the <b>Elemental Planes</b>.&nbsp; Guild members who consistently participate and work as a team will soon reap the rewards of our <b>hard work</b> and <b>self-sacrifice</b>.&nbsp; This is no welfare state.&nbsp; We all work diligently as a community to benefit our guild as a whole.&nbsp; <br /><br />Our <b>long term goal</b> is to <b>maintain a positive atmosphere that is conducive to maintaining some sort of real life existence as well as to progress at a steady pace</b> to get to Time and the end game experience.&nbsp; We do our very best not to leave the average player behind.&nbsp; We want to see every participating Dragons Fist member to succeed alongside one another.&nbsp; <br /><br /><br />Loyalty and dedication plays a prominent role in Dragons Fist.  We will gladly backflag those team players, we feel that are loyal, dedicated, and share our goals.<br /><br />If you are not in control of your life you really shouldn&#039;t be playing this highly addictive game. Dragons Fist is looking for members who know how to keep an in-game/out-of-game balance so that relationships with spouses and loved ones never reach crisis levels and so that careers and educational efforts aren&#039;t ruined. Though we take our game-time seriously, but we also believe that balance is vitally important for long term mental, social and financial stability of all guild members.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: November 18, 2004, 01:45:09 pm by Wyztyz</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Wyztyz Wyckedwytz<br />Wizardess of the Solusek Ro and the 66th Season<br />Broodmother and Guild Leader to Dragons Fist on Rodcet Nife<br />RL &gt; EQ.  Keep it in perspective!
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
