							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If anyone has any comments, questions or concerns about Dragons Fist or any of its members, the following are a list of our officers that can be contacted in game.<br /><br /><br />Guild Leader<br />Lyztyz: Monk<br /><br /><br />High Council<br />Funeral:&nbsp; Necro<br />Syncopated:&nbsp; Bard<br />Tgressus:&nbsp; Warrior<br /><br /><br />Raid Officer<br /><br /><br />Recruitment Officer<br />Bonechip: Necro<br />Funeral:&nbsp; Necro<br /><br />Class Officers<br />Bard:<br />Syncopated<br />Beastlord:<br />Stowtdood<br />Berserker:<br /><br />Cleric:<br />Kainoa<br />Kissnya<br />Druid:<br />Walnuts<br />Enchanter:<br />Aaenayan<br />Indicai<br />Magician:<br />Blasst<br />Wicc<br />Monk:<br />Lyztyz<br />Necromancer:<br />Funeral<br />Bonechip<br />Paladin: <br /><br />Ranger:<br />Nikoli<br />Rogue:<br /><br />Shadow Knight:<br />Giek<br />Jinyx<br />Shaman:<br /><br />Warrior:<br />Tgressus<br />Wizard:<br />Zasda<br />Wyztyz<br />
