							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Dragons Fist took the summer off of raiding and spent time enjoying the sun offline.&nbsp; We waited for the kids to go back to school.&nbsp; We are&nbsp; back in business with raiding after the Labor Day weekend.&nbsp; We will be accepting applications.&nbsp; Come join the fun in an all adult guild.&nbsp; 
